{"1896900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rail Route: The Story of Jozic", "steam_appid": 1896900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Want more? Get the full experience!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Every train needs a dispatcher—and, there’s one dispatcher in particular that needs your help. In Rail Route: The Story of Jozic, you take on the role of an apprentice train dispatcher, loosely guided through the construction of your first, major rail network by a warm, albeit mysterious, mentor… Jozic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/77ab7bffaceb44d705e2f6ede45be03a.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of a real-life train dispatcher, and take on the day-to-day challenges of the role. From ensuring that your trains arrive on time, to planning the most efficient routes possible, you’ll be making sure the people of Prague get to their destinations on time on your journey to become a master train dispatcher!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/8727a42a6ed3f406f4b0bb07337c0988.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>As you begin to unravel the narrative of Jozic, you’ll start to unlock some new upgrades for your network. From faster tracks to full automation of your network, you’ll be hitting eureka moments almost as much as Jozic!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/b080f000dbdc354a1647542f2378ed2b.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Rail Route: The Story of Jozic takes place in an accurate rail-map of The City of Prague! Complete with real-life station and place names (as well as Jozic’s favourite recollections of them…), you’ll get the chance to make your own mark on the city!", "about_the_game": "Every train needs a dispatcher—and, there’s one dispatcher in particular that needs your help. In Rail Route: The Story of Jozic, you take on the role of an apprentice train dispatcher, loosely guided through the construction of your first, major rail network by a warm, albeit mysterious, mentor… Jozic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/77ab7bffaceb44d705e2f6ede45be03a.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of a real-life train dispatcher, and take on the day-to-day challenges of the role. From ensuring that your trains arrive on time, to planning the most efficient routes possible, you’ll be making sure the people of Prague get to their destinations on time on your journey to become a master train dispatcher!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/8727a42a6ed3f406f4b0bb07337c0988.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>As you begin to unravel the narrative of Jozic, you’ll start to unlock some new upgrades for your network. From faster tracks to full automation of your network, you’ll be hitting eureka moments almost as much as Jozic!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/extras/b080f000dbdc354a1647542f2378ed2b.avif?t=1697462811\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Rail Route: The Story of Jozic takes place in an accurate rail-map of The City of Prague! Complete with real-life station and place names (as well as Jozic’s favourite recollections of them…), you’ll get the chance to make your own mark on the city!", "short_description": "In “The Story of Jozic” a free stand alone expansion from the developers behind Rail Route you will take on the role of an apprentice train dispatcher in the bustling city of Prague - design, construct and automate your own railway network in real time!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/header.jpg?t=1697462811", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1697462811", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1697462811", "website": "https://railroute.eu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> On board<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> On board</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4